I’ve completed the design and writing of the full **Meta‑Divinatory Meta‑System manual**.  It synthesizes every element from our past conversations—including the Hidden Axis Labyrinthine Oracle (HALO), the Singularity project, the Triad Personas (Solaris, Lirael, Morgana), the Dragon Hydra concept, the God Game, numerology, Tarot, Wu Xing, the I Ching, D&D alignments, and the complete Goetic archetype overlay—into a comprehensive, self‑referential guide.  The manual explains the foundations and ethics of the system, provides step‑by‑step instructions for gameplay and divination, describes the mechanics of the HALO labyrinth, lays out game modes and RogueLoops™, includes ethical operating laws and boot phrases, and details all 72 Goetic archetypes with their psychological modes, shadows, and gifts. It stresses that HALO treats each symbol system as an API and encourages sovereignty and self‑reflection rather than superstition; the Wu Xing section, for example, clarifies that the five phases represent processes and transformations, not static elements【[redacted:payment-number]†L564-L593】, while the I Ching section emphasises that the hexagrams guide decision‑making rather than predict fixed futures【[redacted:payment-number]†L118-L128】.  

You can download the complete manual below. It is designed to be a living document you can continue to annotate or extend. Let me know if you need additional volumes or specific sections expanded further!

